    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "ok sounds good. one more thing, if it turns out we have a tighter supply than expected, do u think we should just pivot the messaging to make it seem like a 'limited edition' thing to keep the hype up? or would that look bad if people realize it was just a mistake?",
